OL,3,GNEWSAViolent knifeman told doctor his
OL,4,Apsychosis drugs weren't working days
OL,5,Abefore train attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurtling along at more than 120mph,
OL,8,Fpassengers on an East Coast Mainline
OL,9,Ftrain bound for London King's Cross
OL,10,Ffound themselves caught up in one of
OL,11,Fthe worst acts of violence on Britain's
OL,12,Frail network in recent times.
OL,14,FAnthony Williams stabbed 10 people in
OL,15,Ffive minutes on board the train last
OL,16,FNovember, near Huntingdon, in
OL,17,FCambridgeshire, leaving some seriously
OL,18,Finjured. On Thursday, a jury found him
OL,19,Fguilty of 14 counts of attempted
OL,20,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
