OL,3,GNEWSAViolent knifeman told doctor his
OL,4,Apsychosis drugs weren't working days
OL,5,Abefore train attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has now emerged that, in the month
OL,8,Fbefore that attack, the knifeman had
OL,9,Ftwice contacted his GP to say the
OL,10,Fanti-psychosis drugs he was taking for
OL,11,Fschizophrenia were not working.
OL,13,FBut he never saw a doctor and did not
OL,14,Freceive additional mental health
OL,15,Ftreatment.
